{"unit_id":"ssamurias__dsh-fish#card-zh","repo":"ssamurias/dsh-fish","commit":"34277e4caa0700bf742009d7999ea23f9de055f5","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"大肥鱼（DSH 网页与桌面客户端插件）：把 DSH 变成一位通过经历逐渐形成记忆与立场的成长型伙伴。插件在会话中注册成长记录、回忆、日记、B站浏览与互动等工具，并提供专属会话、设置面板和后台唤醒。她可以积累事件、回顾旧事、写日记和便笺，也能按配置主动开口、做梦或浏览视频。适合想体验可持续成长的对话伙伴、管理长期交流记忆并让伙伴接触视频内容的用户。无需模型 API key；B站互动需登录，画面抽取需本地 ffmpeg。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:341-391","lib/capture.js:54-109","lib/proactive.js:433-502","lib/watch.js:32-63","lib/bili.js:32"]}
{"unit_id":"ssamurias__dsh-fish#card-en","repo":"ssamurias/dsh-fish","commit":"34277e4caa0700bf742009d7999ea23f9de055f5","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"大肥鱼 (dsh-fish) is a DSH companion that develops memory and viewpoints through experience. It offers event recall, diaries, notes, Bilibili browsing, a dedicated session, and settings. It can speak proactively and dream. Bilibili interaction needs login; video frames need local ffmpeg.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:341-391","lib/capture.js:54-109","lib/proactive.js:433-502","lib/watch.js:32-63","lib/bili.js:32"]}
